<title>JAPAN: Toyo Officemation plans share split.</title>
<headline>Toyo Officemation plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Officemation Inc said on Wednesday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as off March 31.</p>
</text>
